## mac-look-ahead (missionaries and cannibals, look-ahead search through selection-world,
## failure on outnumbering and on repeated situations, chunking) under the world conventions
## (the shared library, no external environment: ^environment none).

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

chunk always
chunk add-osk on
multi-attributes object 3
multi-attributes ancestor 20

source mac-world.soar
source mac-move-boat.soar
source mac-search-control.soar
source mac-look-ahead-rules.soar
